' `camp.ogg` on every garrison (`preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30
' party`: the leader and one companion handed over, a prepared state; the
' mercenary hired as in v12_dismiss_question). v1.2's
' `GarrisonSelectedCharacter` (LocationScene.cs:1182-1187) plays it whenever
' a member stays, on free ground and on the player's own camp
' (`OnMenuMakeCamp`, :1164-1180): two `sound camp.ogg` lines, one for each
' `join`. v0.9.1 played it on free ground only (the legacy game keeps that).
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
mapclick 72,152          ' the snake lying here
wait 150
uiclick 266,118
wait 10
esc
wait 10
clickon 106              ' the mercenary: the talk opens
wait 30
press down
press down               ' "Would you like to work for me?"
press space
wait 3
press space              ' the first answer lit
press down               ' "OK, you'll get snake"
press space              ' hired
wait 20
join                     ' one stays: free ground, the place is ours
wait 10
join                     ' another stays: our own camp
wait 10
quit
